    "legal.eyebrow": "Member services",
    "legal.title": "Help when you're <em>stuck</em>.",
    "legal.lead": "You can count on us with legal and tax matters, free of charge for members.",
    "legal.1.t": "Civil-law matters",
    "legal.1.d": "We run a legal aid service for our members. Our lawyer also sees members in person every Wednesday from 8:00 to 13:00 at the union office.",
    "legal.2.t": "Employment-law matters",
    "legal.2.d": "VDSZ employment lawyers help our members resolve employment-law questions. If you have a problem like this, get in touch!",
