    "privacy.docs": "Data processing related to union membership",
    "privacy.body": "<h2>Data controller</h2><p><b>Chinoin Vegyipari Dolgozók Szakszervezete (Chinoin VDSZ)</b><br>Registered office: 1045 Budapest, Tó u. 1–5., Hungary<br>Registration number: 14Pk69.085/1992<br>Tax number: 19021014-1-41<br>Phone: +36 1 505 1678, +36 1 505 1370<br>Email: <a href=\"mailto:chinoinvdsz@gmail.com\">chinoinvdsz@gmail.com</a><br>Data protection officer: Éva Tóth</p><h2>What this notice covers</h2><p>This website and its member area. Data processing related to union membership is described in detail in the <a href=\"assets/docs/adatkezelesi-tajekoztato-tagoknak.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">privacy notice for members</a> and the <a href=\"assets/docs/adatvedelmi-szabalyzat.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">general data protection policy</a> (both in Hungarian).</p><h2>What we collect and why</h2><h3>Online application</h3><p>Name, email address, phone number (optional), workplace, job title and the membership type you choose, so that we can contact you about joining. Because an application indicates trade union membership, it is special-category data, so it is processed on the basis of your explicit consent (GDPR Article 6(1)(a) and Article 9(2)(a)). If you join, we keep your data as part of the membership register; otherwise we delete it once your application is closed.</p><h3>Contact form</h3><p>Name, email address and your message, so that we can reply, based on your consent. We delete it once the matter is closed.</p><h3>Member area</h3><p>Member ID, name, workplace and an irreversibly encrypted form of your password, so that you only see content for your own workplace. The legal basis is your membership; access ends when your membership ends.</p><h3>What your browser stores</h3><p>Your language choice and, after you log in, your session until you close the browser are kept in your browser's own storage. We use no cookies, no visitor analytics and no advertising trackers.</p><h2>Processors</h2><p>The website is hosted by Vercel Inc. Applications, member-area data and documents are stored by Supabase Inc. in a data centre in the European Union. If you send a form by email, the message arrives in the chinoinvdsz@gmail.com mailbox (Google). Processors only handle data on our instructions and under contractual confidentiality. We never sell your data or pass it on to third parties.</p><h2>Security</h2><p>The connection is encrypted (HTTPS). Member-area content is only available to logged-in members, each seeing only their own workplace. Documents open through unique, short-lived links.</p><h2>Your rights</h2><ul><li>you can ask for information about how your data is processed and access it;</li><li>you can ask for your data to be corrected, deleted or its processing restricted;</li><li>you can object to processing and ask to receive your data (data portability);</li><li>you can withdraw your consent at any time; this doesn't affect processing carried out before withdrawal.</li></ul><p>Send your request to the contacts above. We reply within 30 days at the latest.</p><h2>Remedies</h2><p>You can complain to the Hungarian National Authority for Data Protection and Freedom of Information (NAIH, 1055 Budapest, Falk Miksa utca 9–11.; postal address: 1363 Budapest, Pf. 9.; <a href=\"https://naih.hu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">naih.hu</a>) or go to court, including the regional court for your place of residence.</p><p class=\"prose-date\">Last updated: November 2026</p>",
